# UrbanSkin – Google Ads Campaign Setup

## About the Project
Built a skincare website and set up a Google Ads Search campaign
as a hands-on digital marketing project.

## What I Did
- Created a skincare landing page
- Set up a lead-generation form
- Conducted keyword research
- Created Google Ads ad groups
- Developed ad copy
- Configured targeting and campaign budget
- Set up campaign tracking

## Tools Used
- Google Ads
- Google Sheets
- Google Apps Script
- HTML/CSS
- Netlify

## Project Objective
To gain practical experience in building a landing page and
setting up a Google Ads campaign from scratch.

## Disclaimer
This was a self-directed practice project and did not involve
paid advertising spend or a real client.
